{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "delivery/a-scoped-cancel-reaches-only-its-organization-s-delivery",
  "title": "A cancel for an organization reaches a delivery from its call's start when the call names that organization, once its room is read otherwise; another organization's never reaches it",
  "rules": [
    "§10.1 Explicit delivery cancellation",
    "§17.2"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: src/roomkit/core/_delivery_keys.py, src/roomkit/core/mixins/inbound.py (cancel_delivery); tests/test_delivery_cancel_turns.py::test_a_scoped_cancel_before_the_commit_reaches_only_its_organization[named-its-organization], [room-read], [room-read-identifying], [read-other-organization], [named-other-organization] (RMK-1152): one, two, three, four and five in that order of cases, each held at its parse or its sender's resolution.",
  "setup": {
